    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11597,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217415",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Death_05c0d08",
      "source": "Jacket: Мама, папа, простите меня.",
      "target": "Jacket: Anya, apa, bocsássatok meg nekem.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11598,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217414",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Ears_DontShoot_02aed9f",
      "source": "Jacket: Зачем вы тогда доставали ружьё? НАХЕРА!?",
      "target": "Jacket: Akkor miért vette elő a puskát? MI A FASZÉRT!?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11599,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217413",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Ears_DontShoot_0b3d06f",
      "source": "Jacket: …",
      "target": "Jacket: …",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-039.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11600,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217412",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Ears_DontShoot_0dbf79a",
      "source": "Jacket: Я что, не Гость?",
      "target": "Jacket: Akkor én nem vagyok Vendég?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11601,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217411",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Photo_DontShoot_05b56a0",
      "source": "Jacket: Странная эта штука — аура-камера…",
      "target": "Jacket: Furcsa szerkezet ez az aurakamera…",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11602,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217410",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Photo_DontShoot_0c807dc",
      "source": "Jacket: Фух, я боялся что там много пятен.",
      "target": "Jacket: Huh, attól féltem, hogy sok folt lesz rajta.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11603,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217409",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Photo_DontShoot_050d1d4",
      "source": "Jacket: Вы приняли принт на моей куртке на ауре за признак Гостя?",
      "target": "Jacket: A kabátom mintáját az auraképen a Vendég jelének nézte?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11604,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217408",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Armpit_DontShoot_0496af8",
      "source": "Jacket: Если вы в раздумьях, и ещё не решили, кто перед вами, — может, не надо доставать ружьё и пугать до усрачки?",
      "target": "Jacket: Ha még gondolkodik, és nem döntötte el, ki áll ön előtt, talán nem kellene elővennie a puskát és halálra rémítenie!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11605,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023114",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Armpit_DontShoot_01f5263",
      "source": "Jacket: Спасибо, что не нажали на спусковой крючок, но…",
      "target": "Jacket: Köszönöm, hogy nem húzta meg a ravaszt, de…",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11606,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023113",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Armpit_DontShoot_0188533",
      "source": "Jacket: …",
      "target": "Jacket: …",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-039.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11607,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023112",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Armpit_DontShoot_0d51581",
      "source": "Jacket: Вы передумали убивать меня?",
      "target": "Jacket: Meggondolta magát, és mégsem öl meg?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11608,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023111",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Eyes_DontShoot_0284e2e",
      "source": "Jacket: Признаюсь, даже не знал, что это является признаком.",
      "target": "Jacket: Bevallom, nem is tudtam, hogy ez jelnek számít.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11609,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023110",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Eyes_DontShoot_08b0986",
      "source": "Jacket: …",
      "target": "Jacket: …",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-039.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11610,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023109",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Eyes_DontShoot_0235f72",
      "source": "Jacket: Бегающий зрачок — это знак Гостя?",
      "target": "Jacket: Az ide-oda mozgó pupilla a Vendég jele?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11611,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023108",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Eyes_DontShoot_007127f",
      "source": "Jacket: Постойте…",
      "target": "Jacket: Várjon…",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11612,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023107",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Eyes_DontShoot_0af6850",
      "source": "Jacket: Что было признаком!? За что вы достали…",
      "target": "Jacket: Mi számított jelnek!? Miért vette elő…",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11613,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023106",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Hands_DontShoot_04f00d6",
      "source": "Jacket: У меня сердце в пятки ушло. Зачем вы так?",
      "target": "Jacket: Majdnem kiugrott a szívem a helyéről. Miért csinálta ezt?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11614,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023105",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Hands_DontShoot_013106b",
      "source": "Jacket: Вы специально, что ли?!",
      "target": "Jacket: Ezt szándékosan csinálta!?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11615,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023104",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Teeth_DontShoot_0264b07",
      "source": "Jacket: У меня аж вся жизнь пронеслась перед глазами.",
      "target": "Jacket: Lepörgött előttem az egész életem.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11616,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453914828805",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Teeth_DontShoot_0b280b3",
      "source": "Jacket: Спасибо, что не выстрелили.",
      "target": "Jacket: Köszönöm, hogy nem lőtt le.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11617,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453914828804",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Ears_Gun_04be62e",
      "source": "Выслушать",
      "target": "Meghallgatás",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11618,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453914828803",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Ears_Gun_02b1da2",
      "source": "Выстрелить",
      "target": "Lövés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11619,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453914828802",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Ears_Gun_0c9d31b",
      "source": "Jacket: Что там?",
      "target": "Jacket: Mi van ott?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11620,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453914828801",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Ears_Gun_0d0912b",
      "source": "Jacket: Стойте, что не так с ушами?",
      "target": "Jacket: Várjon, mi baj van a fülemmel?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11621,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453914828800",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Photo_Gun_00d003b",
      "source": "Выслушать",
      "target": "Meghallgatás",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11622,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634506",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Photo_Gun_0b01cc8",
      "source": "Выстрелить",
      "target": "Lövés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11623,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634505",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Photo_Gun_034a7c5",
      "source": "Jacket: На ауре что-то есть?",
      "target": "Jacket: Látszik valami az aurámon?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11624,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634504",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Photo_Gun_022edf3",
      "source": "Jacket: Стойте, стойте! Что не так?",
      "target": "Jacket: Várjon, várjon! Mi a baj?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11625,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634503",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Armpit_Gun_086ad74",
      "source": "Выслушать",
      "target": "Meghallgatás",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11626,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634502",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Armpit_Gun_05e36a8",
      "source": "Выстрелить",
      "target": "Lövés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11627,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634501",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Armpit_Gun_09bfbc9",
      "source": "Jacket: ЧЁРТ, ЧЁРТ, ЧЁРТ!!!",
      "target": "Jacket: A FENÉBE, A FENÉBE, A FENÉBE!!!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11628,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634500",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Armpit_Gun_03f3588",
      "source": "Jacket: Проклятье, я правда Гость?!",
      "target": "Jacket: A francba, tényleg Vendég vagyok?!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11629,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634499",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Eyes_Gun_011d7e7",
      "source": "Выслушать",
      "target": "Meghallgatás",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11630,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634498",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Eyes_Gun_0e4d6e7",
      "source": "Выстрелить",
      "target": "Lövés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11631,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634497",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Eyes_Gun_0e8e5c2",
      "source": "Jacket: Но глаза ведь не красные!",
      "target": "Jacket: De a szemem nem is vörös!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11632,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634496",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Eyes_Gun_032f3d5",
      "source": "Jacket: Что?! Я Гость?",
      "target": "Jacket: Mi?! Vendég vagyok?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11633,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440202",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Hands_Gun_0849c48",
      "source": "Выслушать",
      "target": "Meghallgatás",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11634,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440201",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Hands_Gun_0500823",
      "source": "Выстрелить",
      "target": "Lövés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11635,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440200",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Hands_Gun_0dc2ef1",
      "source": "Jacket: Я НЕ ГОСТЬ, НЕ СТРЕЛЯЙТЕ!!!",
      "target": "Jacket: NEM VAGYOK VENDÉG, NE LŐJÖN!!!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11636,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440199",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Hands_Gun_091c1bf",
      "source": "Jacket: Постойте, но на руках ведь ничего нет!",
      "target": "Jacket: Várjon, de semmi sincs a kezemen!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-360.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11637,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440198",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Jacket_Hands_Gun_07d4abb",
      "source": "Jacket: Постойте, но я же объяснил, что раздражение из-за куртки!",
      "target": "Jacket: Várjon, hiszen elmagyaráztam, hogy a kabát irritálja a bőrömet!",
